@title Chosen enclosure with default numbers: too deep is a warning
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The EMC cabinet with a 900 x 500 x 240 enclosure whose numbers are program defaults (synthetic): -T1 is too deep for the door, shown as a warning with the estimate notice, not as an error.
open qa/fixtures/enclosure-spec-default.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Problems
key enter
wait 10
expect "too deep"
expect "enclosure data: default"
expect "Estimate from program defaults"
shot too-deep-warning-default-numbers
check_layout
